# k.colours/shards/psys2: from the PSys2 world kids.shapes: which colours are primary, secondary and neutral, and 2 more things of a colour (fire truck, ocean); and from the PSys2 drawing world and lexicon: 1 colour (skin) with a usual RGB value and 11 words for colours (moved from k.values/shards/psys2, KR2).
# sources: psys2-worlds 6b63b2ba (the hand-written knowledge of the PSys2 tab worlds, the project's own data)
# license: CC0-1.0
# script: tools/import/psys2.mjs

